
precompilation:
---------------

administration 105 standalon PER 1   1:   LEX: «Administration».

administration 105 standalon PER 1   3:   The "«Manager»" is a person.
administration 105 standalon PER 1   4:   A "«Secretary»" is a person.
administration 105 standalon PER 1   5:   "«Proposed New Secretary»" is a person.
administration 105 standalon PER 1   6:   "«Accepted New Secretary»" is a person.

administration 105 standalon PER 1   8:   The «Manager» appoints the «Secretary».


administration 105 standalon PER 1  11:   CLAUSE: «New Secretary».
administration 105 standalon PER 1  12:   The «Manager» may appoint a new «Secretary».

administration 105 standalon PER 1  14:   CLAUSE: «New Manager».
administration 105 standalon PER 1  15:   The «Manager» may appoint a new «Manager».


administration 105 standalon PER 1  18:   PER «Member»:

administration 105 standalon PER 1  20:   "«Proposal»" is a text.
administration 105 standalon PER 1  21:   "«Member»" is a person.

administration 105 standalon PER 1  23:   The «Secretary» may appoint a «Member».

administration 105 standalon PER 1  25:   CLAUSE: «Notify».
administration 105 standalon PER 1  26:   The «Member» may send a «Proposal» to the «Manager».

administration 105 standalon PER 1  28:   CLAUSE: «Acknowledge».
administration 105 standalon PER 1  29:   The «Secretary» may notify the «Member» of "‹Acknowledgement the Proposal›".

